WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.063
Day 4. A pair with two sounds.

2
00:00:02.513 --> 00:00:09.326
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:09.826 --> 00:00:15.198
Here is today's pair. It has two sounds: a quiet one, and one that buzzes. Listen.

4
00:00:18.201 --> 00:00:20.473
For both, the tongue goes between the teeth.

5
00:00:24.189 --> 00:00:25.189
The word is thin.

6
00:00:29.349 --> 00:00:30.408
The word is this.

7
00:00:31.308 --> 00:00:35.462
If the quiet sound does not make a word, your child tries the buzzing one.

8
00:00:35.912 --> 00:00:40.468
The words to say to your child are in the yellow box at the top. Read them out.

9
00:00:40.918 --> 00:00:45.918
Do the four pairs of job one together. The first word, then the word with the pair.

10
00:00:46.368 --> 00:00:50.401
If a word goes wrong, do not say it. Say the same words every time.

11
00:00:50.851 --> 00:00:53.930
Two letters, one sound. Find the pair. Then wait.

12
00:00:54.730 --> 00:01:00.303
For job two, press play for your child and step away. The voice waits, then says each word.

13
00:01:00.753 --> 00:01:04.216
At the end, your child reads three words to you. Mark each one.
